          "text": "Témoignages: SAINT-SATURNIN-LES-APT (84) 04.07.2008 Questionnaire terre-R.pdf SAUMANE-DE-VAUCLUSE (84) 04.07.2008 T1 Questionnaire terre-R.pdf",
          "text_sha256": "5a23e2cff7e81f0fc93c42eb20d61b573901331f6d96d8dddc73cdc43145591f"
